{"unit_id":"Rosa42__dsh-sync#card-zh","repo":"Rosa42/dsh-sync","commit":"22754c548c01467f65ddf2e36076624de4fcaae7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sync 是面向 DSH Web 的主目录同步插件，通过 Settings 中的 Sync 页面调用 rclone bisync，在不同机器间双向同步会话、附件、配置档案和选定的主目录设置。页面可选择 rclone remote 或本地镜像目录，配置同步范围、排除规则、冲突策略和删除上限，并提供变更预览、立即同步、首次播种及目标连通性检查。适合需要在多台设备间延续 DSH 会话与配置的用户；本机需要安装 rclone，云端目标需自行配置远端。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:827-832","index.js:523-578","index.js:620-716"]}
{"unit_id":"Rosa42__dsh-sync#card-en","repo":"Rosa42/dsh-sync","commit":"22754c548c01467f65ddf2e36076624de4fcaae7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sync adds a DSH Web page for syncing selected home folders across machines with rclone bisync. Choose a remote or local mirror, adjust filters and conflict options, probe the target, preview changes, sync, or seed a pair. Requires local rclone and a configured cloud remote.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:827-832","index.js:523-578","index.js:620-716"]}
